# Escalation test plan guidance

This generated project contains a metadata-grounded manual test plan. It does not authorize automatic execution or production changes.

- Read the generated README first, then the scenario and execution documents actually included in this output. HTML output uses `test-dashboard.html`; Markdown output uses `TEST_SCENARIOS.md`, `TEST_EXECUTION_GUIDE.md`, and `QUICK_REFERENCE.md`.
- Use the selected sandbox or scratch org and the documented queue, presence, and routing configuration. Ask before changing the target org or test scope.
- Human testers perform the scenarios. Use the generated `queries/` files for verification and record observed outcomes in the supplied log or dashboard. Do not mark unexecuted scenarios as passing.
- Keep credentials in 1Password and unread. Never commit `.env` files, access tokens, or real customer records. Commit or share sanitized results only within the authorized scope.
- When org configuration changes, regenerate the plan with the `agentforce-escalation-test-generator` skill, compare scenarios, and preserve prior results as dated evidence.
- This project has no application build. Verify generated links, filenames, query targets, and scenario prerequisites; inspect the HTML dashboard in the in-app Browser when included.
